---
import Document from "../layouts/Document.astro";
import { site } from "../data/universe";
import { getLocale, localizePath } from "../i18n";
const locale = getLocale(Astro.url.pathname);
const copy = {
  en: {
    title: "A universe, quite by accident.",
    label: "About All Hail the Cone",
    description:
      "An independent creative universe born from surreal imagery. A serious home for impossible places, ordinary kindness and one sacred traffic cone.",
    sections: [
      [
        "The pictures came first",
        "All Hail the Cone began with surreal, AI-generated images: a crowned astronaut capybara, a working banana, a pigeon executive, devoted robots and an orange cone. Their strange consistency suggested a place.",
        "This is that place’s first public archive. The project is independently developed by marquezinii. The supplied artwork forms its visual foundation; its names, institutions and written continuity were developed for this edition.",
      ],
      [
        "The absurd does not need permission",
        "Inside this universe, nobody is surprised that a banana has a job or that a pigeon runs Bread Operations. The humour comes from taking those responsibilities seriously.",
        "The Cone remains a traffic cone. Explaining it completely would make the world smaller.",
      ],
      [
        "A long horizon",
        "The archive can grow into stories, comics, animation, maps, games and community interpretations. This edition establishes a place to begin, not a list of promised releases.",
        "Official continuity, tentative ideas and open experimentation each have a place.",
      ],
      [
        "Made in the open",
        "The website and documentation are available in the official repository. Public source makes the project inspectable; licensing and contribution terms still apply.",
        "",
      ],
      [
        "Start wherever you like",
        "Read the orientation, meet the central figures, wander through the visual archive or find your way to the community. There is no required order.",
        "",
      ],
    ],
  },
  pt: {
    title: "Um universo, quase por acidente.",
    label: "Sobre All Hail the Cone",
    description:
      "Um universo criativo independente nascido de imagens surrealistas. Um lar sério para lugares impossíveis, gentileza cotidiana e um cone de trânsito sagrado.",
    sections: [
      [
        "As imagens vieram primeiro",
        "All Hail the Cone começou com imagens surreais geradas por IA: uma capivara astronauta coroada, uma banana trabalhando, um pombo executivo, robôs devotos e um cone laranja. A estranha coerência entre elas sugeria um lugar.",
        "Este é o primeiro arquivo público desse lugar. O projeto é desenvolvido de forma independente por marquezinii. As obras fornecidas formam sua base visual; nomes, instituições e continuidade escrita foram desenvolvidos para esta edição.",
      ],
      [
        "O absurdo não precisa de permissão",
        "Neste universo, ninguém se surpreende com uma banana empregada ou um pombo comandando Bread Operations. O humor nasce da seriedade dessas responsabilidades.",
        "O Cone continua sendo um cone de trânsito. Explicá-lo por completo tornaria o mundo menor.",
      ],
      [
        "Um horizonte longo",
        "O arquivo pode crescer em histórias, quadrinhos, animações, mapas, jogos e interpretações da comunidade. Esta edição estabelece um ponto de partida.",
        "Continuidade oficial, ideias provisórias e experimentação aberta têm lugares distintos.",
      ],
      [
        "Feito abertamente",
        "O site e a documentação estão no repositório oficial. O código público torna o projeto verificável; licenças e regras de contribuição continuam válidas.",
        "",
      ],
      [
        "Comece onde quiser",
        "Leia a orientação, conheça as figuras centrais, percorra o arquivo visual ou encontre a comunidade. Não existe uma ordem obrigatória.",
        "",
      ],
    ],
  },
  zh: {
    title: "一个近乎偶然诞生的宇宙。",
    label: "关于 All Hail the Cone",
    description:
      "一个诞生于超现实图像的独立创意宇宙：认真容纳不可能之地、日常善意与一枚神圣交通锥。",
    sections: [
      [
        "图像最先出现",
        "All Hail the Cone 始于一组 AI 生成的超现实图像：王冠宇航员水豚、工作的香蕉、鸽子高管、虔诚机器人和橙色交通锥。它们奇异的一致性指向了一个世界。",
        "这里是那个世界的第一座公共档案馆。项目由 marquezinii 独立开发；用户提供的作品构成视觉基础，名称、机构与文字连续性则为本版建立。",
      ],
      [
        "荒诞无需许可",
        "在这个宇宙里，没有人会惊讶香蕉拥有工作，或鸽子领导 Bread Operations。幽默来自所有人对责任的认真态度。",
        "交通锥依然只是交通锥。彻底解释它，只会让世界变小。",
      ],
      [
        "漫长的地平线",
        "档案未来可以扩展为故事、漫画、动画、地图、游戏与社区诠释。本版只建立起点，并非发布承诺清单。",
        "官方连续性、暂定想法与开放实验各有位置。",
      ],
      [
        "公开创作",
        "网站与文档均位于官方代码仓库。公开源码便于审查，但许可与贡献条款仍然适用。",
        "",
      ],
      [
        "从任何地方开始",
        "阅读世界指引、认识核心角色、漫游视觉档案，或前往社区。这里没有规定顺序。",
        "",
      ],
    ],
  },
  de: {
    title: "Ein Universum, eher zufällig.",
    label: "Über All Hail the Cone",
    description:
      "Ein unabhängiges Kreativuniversum aus surrealen Bildern. Ein ernstes Zuhause für unmögliche Orte, alltägliche Güte und einen heiligen Verkehrskegel.",
    sections: [
      [
        "Die Bilder kamen zuerst",
        "All Hail the Cone begann mit surrealen, KI-generierten Bildern: einem gekrönten Astronauten-Wasserschwein, einer arbeitenden Banane, einer Führungstaube, hingebungsvollen Robotern und einem orangefarbenen Kegel. Ihre seltsame Stimmigkeit deutete auf einen Ort.",
        "Dies ist das erste öffentliche Archiv dieses Ortes. Das Projekt wird unabhängig von marquezinii entwickelt. Die bereitgestellten Werke bilden die visuelle Grundlage; Namen, Institutionen und Kontinuität entstanden für diese Ausgabe.",
      ],
      [
        "Das Absurde braucht keine Erlaubnis",
        "Hier wundert sich niemand über eine Banane mit Beruf oder eine Taube an der Spitze von Bread Operations. Der Humor entsteht aus dem Ernst dieser Aufgaben.",
        "Der Kegel bleibt ein Verkehrskegel. Eine vollständige Erklärung würde die Welt kleiner machen.",
      ],
      [
        "Ein weiter Horizont",
        "Das Archiv kann zu Geschichten, Comics, Animationen, Karten, Spielen und Deutungen der Gemeinschaft wachsen. Diese Ausgabe schafft einen Anfang.",
        "Offizielle Kontinuität, vorläufige Ideen und offenes Experimentieren haben jeweils ihren Platz.",
      ],
      [
        "Offen entwickelt",
        "Website und Dokumentation befinden sich im offiziellen Repository. Öffentlicher Quellcode macht das Projekt prüfbar; Lizenz- und Beitragsregeln gelten weiterhin.",
        "",
      ],
      [
        "Beginne, wo du möchtest",
        "Lies die Orientierung, triff die zentralen Figuren, durchstreife das Bildarchiv oder finde zur Gemeinschaft. Es gibt keine vorgeschriebene Reihenfolge.",
        "",
      ],
    ],
  },
  fr: {
    title: "Un univers, presque par accident.",
    label: "À propos de All Hail the Cone",
    description:
      "Un univers créatif indépendant né d’images surréalistes. Un foyer sérieux pour les lieux impossibles, la bonté ordinaire et un cône de signalisation sacré.",
    sections: [
      [
        "Les images sont venues d’abord",
        "All Hail the Cone est né d’images surréalistes générées par IA : un capybara astronaute couronné, une banane au travail, un pigeon cadre, des robots dévoués et un cône orange. Leur étrange cohérence suggérait un lieu.",
        "Voici les premières archives publiques de ce lieu. Le projet est développé indépendamment par marquezinii. Les œuvres fournies forment sa base visuelle ; les noms, institutions et la continuité écrite ont été créés pour cette édition.",
      ],
      [
        "L’absurde n’a pas besoin de permission",
        "Dans cet univers, personne ne s’étonne qu’une banane ait un emploi ou qu’un pigeon dirige Bread Operations. L’humour naît du sérieux accordé à ces responsabilités.",
        "Le Cône reste un cône de signalisation. L’expliquer entièrement rendrait le monde plus petit.",
      ],
      [
        "Un long horizon",
        "Les archives peuvent devenir récits, bandes dessinées, animations, cartes, jeux et interprétations communautaires. Cette édition pose un point de départ.",
        "Continuité officielle, idées provisoires et expérimentation ouverte ont chacune leur place.",
      ],
      [
        "Créé au grand jour",
        "Le site et sa documentation sont disponibles dans le dépôt officiel. Le code public rend le projet vérifiable ; licences et règles de contribution restent applicables.",
        "",
      ],
      [
        "Commencez où vous voulez",
        "Lisez l’orientation, rencontrez les figures centrales, parcourez les archives visuelles ou rejoignez la communauté. Aucun ordre n’est imposé.",
        "",
      ],
    ],
  },
}[locale];
const links = [
  { section: 0, text: "marquezinii", href: "https://github.com/marquezinii" },
  {
    section: 3,
    text:
      locale === "pt"
        ? "repositório oficial"
        : locale === "zh"
          ? "官方代码仓库"
          : locale === "de"
            ? "offiziellen Repository"
            : locale === "fr"
              ? "dépôt officiel"
              : "official repository",
    href: site.repo,
  },
];
---

<Document title={copy.title} label={copy.label} description={copy.description}>
  {copy.sections.map(([heading, first, second], index) => (
    <>
      <h2>{heading}</h2>
      <p>{first}</p>
      {second && <p>{second}</p>}
      {links
        .filter((link) => link.section === index)
        .map((link) => (
          <p>
            <a href={link.href}>{link.text} ↗</a>
          </p>
        ))}
    </>
  ))}
  <p>
    <a href={localizePath("/lore", locale)}>Lore</a> ·{" "}
    <a href={localizePath("/characters", locale)}>Characters</a> ·{" "}
    <a href={localizePath("/gallery", locale)}>Gallery</a> ·{" "}
    <a href={localizePath("/community", locale)}>Community</a>
  </p>
</Document>
